  "_comment": "Which files each agent may edit (globs relative to the repo root, `*` crosses folders). One owner per file. Read by the code-framework ownership hook and by the fixer's debugging skill. docs/, README.md, pyproject.toml, uv.lock and .github/ belong to the main session (the planner).",
